      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KEY ALIGNMENTS\n\nW=0  ⇔  s = 1.0            home · gear home tooth (Δ=0 emits nothing)\nW=12 ⇔  s = 0.5            EXACT hyperbolic boundary (window=space ⇔ s²=¼) — hyper ⇔ W>12\nΔ=12 ⇔  ×2                 one octave — base-2, timeline-first\nΔ=24 ⇔  ×4                 one full fan24 rim turn (q=1)\nring 144 ⇔ ×4096           12 octaves = 4⁶ — one full wrap\nBFS floor 1e-6 → W=95      deep wrap (∞ side) · expansion s=2 → W=132\nnamed window W∈[0,144) ⇔ s ∈ [2.06e-4, 1] — deeper scales WRAP the ring",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KEY ALIGNMENTS\n\nW=0  ⇔  s = 1.0            home · gear home tooth (Δ=0 emits nothing)\nW=12 ⇔  s = 0.5            EXACT hyperbolic boundary (window=space ⇔ s²=¼) — hyper ⇔ W>12\nΔ=12 ⇔  ×2                 one octave — base-2, timeline-first\nΔ=24 ⇔  ×4                 one full fan24 rim turn (q=1)\nring 144 ⇔ ×4096           12 octaves = 4⁶ — one full wrap\nBFS floor 1e-6 → W=95      deep wrap (∞ side) · expansion s=2 → W=132\nnamed window W∈[0,144) ⇔ s ∈ [2.06e-4, 1] — deeper scales WRAP the ring",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
